      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Shown when the save file was damaged and the backup was used.
    - rid: 636489279681331202
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Shown over everything while the last change could not be written.
    - rid: 636489279681331203
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Writes the unsaved change again.
    - rid: 636489279820791808
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Shown when changing the language failed because settings could
          not be written.
    - rid: 636489282005762048
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Row 1: the row facing the other side.'
    - rid: 636489282005762049
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Row 2.
    - rid: 636489282005762050
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Row 3.
    - rid: 636489282005762054
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Moves a mercenary one row forward (towards row 1); the one
          standing there moves back.
    - rid: 636489282005762055
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Moves a mercenary one row back; the one standing there moves
          forward.
    - rid: 636489282005762059
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Used as {0} of Effect.*. The rearmost enemy.
    - rid: 636489282005762060
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Mercenaries who died in this battle. {0} = names.
    - rid: 636489282005762061
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Enemies killed in this battle. {0} = names.
    - rid: 636489282005762062
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A row of the party emptied. {0} = that row.
    - rid: 636489282005762063
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A row of the enemy emptied. {0} = that row.
    - rid: 636489282763358208
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Row 4: the rearmost row.'
    - rid: 636489282763358210
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Used as {0} of Effect.*. {0} = how many enemies are hit counted
          from the front (2 or more).
    - rid: 636489282763358211
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Used as {0} of Effect.*. {0} = how many enemies are hit counted
          from the back (2 or more).
    - rid: 636489291522375680
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Closes a panel.
    - rid: 636489291522375681
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Opens the log of the finished battle from the result panel.
    - rid: 636489291522375682
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Title of the battle log viewer.
    - rid: 8623673131002232832
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Shown in the figure placeholder of a unit until there is art.
    - rid: 8623673134167883778
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Sends the selected board item to the inventory.
    - rid: 8623673134167883779
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} x {1} = the squares the item takes across and down on
          a board (Slice B stage 19).'
    - rid: 8623673134167883780
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The item only works while its owner stands within the front
          N rows. {0} = N (2 or more).
    - rid: 8623673134167883781
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The item only works in the front row.
    - rid: 8623673134167883782
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The item only works while its owner stands within the rear
          N rows of the living line. {0} = N (2 or more).
    - rid: 8623673134167883783
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The item only works in the rearmost row.
    - rid: 8623673137313349632
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Shown in place of an enemy list: who waits at a node is not
          shown before the battle.'
    - rid: 8623673137313349633
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Opens the inventory window; I does too (round 52).
    - rid: 8623673137313349634
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Closes the inventory window; I does too (round 52).
    - rid: 8623673137313349635
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The inventory popup's squares in use, beside its heading (round
          49). {0} = squares in use. {1} = all its squares.
    - rid: 8623673137313349636
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'How to use the inventory window''s grid (round 49; round
          52: the window lies over the stage, the boards below it, and I opens and
          closes it).'
    - rid: 8623673182117429248
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = dungeon name. {1} = floor of the battle. In the header.'
    - rid: 8623673182117429249
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = HP lost. Rises from the unit hit.'
    - rid: 8623673182117429250
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = damage the shield took.'
    - rid: 8623673182117429251
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = HP restored.'
    - rid: 8623673182117429252
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = shield gained.'
    - rid: 8623673182117429253
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = burn stacks applied.'
    - rid: 8623673182117429254
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A mercenary reached death's door.
    - rid: 8623673182117429255
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A mercenary at death's door survived a death roll.
    - rid: 8623673182117429256
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A unit died.
    - rid: 8623673182117429257
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The retreat roll succeeded.
    - rid: 8623673182117429258
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The retreat roll failed.
    - rid: 8623673182117429259
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = damage of this storm tick. Rises from the clock.'
    - rid: 8623673209745833984
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Item category: defensive gear.'
    - rid: 8623673209745833985
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Item category: an attack that is not a weapon.'
    - rid: 8623673209745833986
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Item category: anything else.'
    - rid: 8623673231716122624
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Button that steps the music volume. {0} = the current step
          (Title.VolumeOn/Low/Off).
    - rid: 8623673231716122625
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Button that steps the sound effects volume. {0} = the current
          step (Title.VolumeOn/Low/Off).
    - rid: 8623673231716122626
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Volume step: full.'
    - rid: 8623673231716122627
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Volume step: low (about half as loud).'
    - rid: 8623673231716122628
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Volume step: silent.'
    - rid: 8623673231716122629
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Shown when changing a volume failed because settings could
          not be written.
    - rid: 8623673235571474432
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the violet tag of a board item that costs fatigue when
          a battle starts. {0} = the cost.
    - rid: 8623673235571474433
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'On the violet tag at the right end of a board''s head: the
          fatigue the board''s equipment costs when a battle starts. {0} = the total.'
    - rid: 8623673235571474434
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'In an item''s facts: equipment that costs fatigue when a
          battle starts. {0} = the cost.'
    - rid: 8623673235571474435
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'In a base weapon''s facts: it costs no fatigue.'
    - rid: 8623673237332819968
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Label of an elite node: a stronger band waits there.'
    - rid: 8623673237332819969
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Label of a camp node: a rest without a fight.'
    - rid: 8623673237332819970
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Shown when an elite node is selected.
    - rid: 8623673237332819971
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Shown when a camp node is selected.
    - rid: 8623673237332819972
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Goes into the selected camp node.
    - rid: 8623673237332819973
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'In the panel while the party is at a camp: the choice is
          in the window over the map.'
    - rid: 8623673237332819974
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: In the camp window under its title.
    - rid: 8623673237332819975
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'The camp''s rest: the title of its card.'
    - rid: 8623673237332819976
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the rest card. {0} = percent of max HP each living mercenary
          heals.
    - rid: 8623673237332819977
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the rest card. {0} = fatigue taken off.
    - rid: 8623673241901465600
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'The camp''s upkeep: the title of its card and of its step.'
    - rid: 8623673241901465601
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the mend card.
    - rid: 8623673241901465602
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Title of the camp window while an item is chosen to mend.
          {0} = floor.
    - rid: 8623673241901465603
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: In the camp window while an item is chosen to mend.
    - rid: 8623673241901465604
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Leaves the mend step for the camp's two choices.
    - rid: 8623673241901465605
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Mends the chosen item and goes on.
    - rid: 8623673241901465606
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On a board cell the chosen item would merge into. {0} = the
          tier the merge makes.
    - rid: 8623673241901465611
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Under a chosen item's facts when a board holds the same item
          at the same tier. {0} = item name. {1} = its tier. {2} = the tier up.
    - rid: 8623673241901465612
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A value before and after a change. {0} = before. {1} = after.
    - rid: 8623673243377860608
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'On a roster line of a mercenary in an affliction: the fatigue
          words, then the affliction''s name. {0} = the fatigue words (Lobby.Fatigue).
          {1} = the affliction.'
    - rid: 8623673243377860609
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the state line under a party member's feet while the member
          is in a state of the breakdown. {0} = job. {1} = the state's name (an affliction
          or a virtue).
    - rid: 8623673243377860610
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the detail line when the state's name under a member's
          feet was clicked. {0} = the state's name. {1} = what it does.
    - rid: 8623673243377860611
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = unit. {1} = the affliction. {2} = roll 0..99. {3} =
          virtue chance (a roll below it is a virtue).'
    - rid: 8623673243377860612
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = unit. {1} = the virtue. {2} = roll. {3} = virtue chance.'
    - rid: 8623673243377860613
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = unit. Its fatigue reached the maximum: death''s door,
          or death if it was there already (the death is logged after).'
    - rid: 8623673243377860614
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = unit. {1} = the affliction that ended because the fatigue
          came back under the threshold.'
    - rid: 8623673243377860615
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Fatigue from reaching death's door. {0} = unit. {1} = amount.
          {2} = fatigue after.
    - rid: 8623673243377860616
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Fatigue from an ally reaching death's door. {0} = unit. {1}
          = amount. {2} = fatigue after.
    - rid: 8623673243377860617
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Fatigue from an ally's death. {0} = unit. {1} = amount. {2}
          = fatigue after.
    - rid: 8623673243377860618
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A virtue brought the fatigue down. {0} = unit. {1} = the change
          (negative). {2} = fatigue after.
    - rid: 8623673243377860619
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: One survivor in Settle.Fatigue who came back in an affliction.
          {0} = name and fatigue. {1} = the affliction.
    - rid: 8623673243377860622
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The word over a mercenary whose fatigue reached its maximum,
          in the moment of its collapse (it went to death's door, or died there).
          The unit's name is written under it.
    - rid: 8623673257781362689
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "The tier an item is found at. Not written in titles; only
          where a tier word is needed (the camp's mend: \uC77C\uBC18 \u2192 1\uC131)."
    - rid: 8623673257781362690
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Item.MergeHint for a Common item, which names no tier of its
          own. {0} = item name. {1} = the tier up.
    - rid: 8623673275332689920
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Label of a shop node: items for the region coins, no fight
          (round 44).'
    - rid: 8623673275332689921
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Shown when a shop node is selected.
    - rid: 8623673275332689922
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Goes into the selected shop node.
    - rid: 8623673275332689923
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'In the panel while the party is at a shop: the buying is
          in the window over the map.'
    - rid: 8623673275332689924
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: In the shop window under its title.
    - rid: 8623673275332689925
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: In the panel while an offer of the shop is picked.
    - rid: 8623673275332689926
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: In the shop window before the coins the party has.
    - rid: 8623673275332689927
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The shop's refresh button; its cost follows.
    - rid: 8623673275332689928
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Leaves the shop and goes on to the next floor.
    - rid: 8623673275332689931
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the detail line after a purchase. {0} = what was bought.
          {1} = coins before. {2} = coins after.
    - rid: 8623673275332689932
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A number of region coins beside the coin mark (the header;
          an offer's price; the refresh cost). {0} = coins.
    - rid: 8623673275332689933
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'On the result window: the region coins the victory brought
          (round 44). {0} = coins.'
    - rid: 8623673277520543744
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Under the name of a potion on offer in the shop.
    - rid: 8623673277520543746
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the band over the stage when the app comes back to the
          loot of a won battle (round 47; the loot screen's header before it).
    - rid: 8623673277520543750
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Over the picked drop.
    - rid: 8623673277520543753
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Takes the picked drop (or the shop's picked offer) straight
          into the inventory.
    - rid: 8623673296729145344
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'On the band over the stage after a win (round 47): how many
          drops lie on the floor. {0} = the count.'
    - rid: 8623673296729145345
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the board panel after a win, while no drop is picked (round
          47; the A key 2026-10-17).
    - rid: 8623673296729145346
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the board panel after a win, while a drop is picked (round
          47, stage 19).
    - rid: 8623673301822865408
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Under the name of a bag on offer or dropped (Slice B stage
          19). {0} x {1} = its squares across and down.
    - rid: 8623673301822865409
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The facts of a bag on a tile (Slice B stage 19). {0} = the
          squares it adds.
    - rid: 8623673301822865410
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Over a held item's ghost where it would push one item out
          (Slice B stage 19). {0} = that item's name.
    - rid: 8623673301822865411
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Over a held bag's ghost where it can be laid (Slice B stage
          19).
    - rid: 8623673317018566656
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The heading of the inventory popup (round 49).
    - rid: 8623673317018566657
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Under a held item''s tooltip in the inventory popup (round
          49): how to turn it and let go.'
    - rid: 8623673318725910528
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Why a mercenary died when the fatigue collapse killed it
          at death''s door: no last hit and no death roll (it may never have been
          hit). {0} = name. {1} = time of reaching 0 HP (0 when it entered the battle
          there). {2} = time of death.'
    - rid: 8623673332876705792
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'In an item''s facts: a melee weapon, which the stars of a
          whetstone strengthen (Slice B stage 20).'
    - rid: 8623673332876705793
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'In an item''s facts in place of its cooldown: an item that
          never activates and works by its stars (stage 20).'
    - rid: 8623673332876705794
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'The effect line of a star item (stage 20): a melee weapon
          on one of its stars deals more. {0} = how much.'
    - rid: 8623673332876705795
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'On a melee weapon''s card under its effects (stage 20), which
          already count it: what the stars on it add. {0} = the star items'' names.
          {1} = the damage they add.'
    - rid: 8623673332876705796
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'On a star item''s card (stage 20): how many of its stars
          a melee weapon lies on, and which. {0} = lit. {1} = all. {2} = the weapons''
          names.'
    - rid: 8623673332876705797
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On a star item's card when no melee weapon lies on its stars
          (stage 20). {0} = its stars.
    - rid: 8623673342610898944
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The price line of a good in the merchant's tooltip (Slice
          B stage 21). {0} = the coins.
    - rid: 8623673344893911040
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The title of an item above Common (round 57 without the grade;
          round 69 with the star word). {0} = item name. {1} = tier. A Common item
          shows its name alone.
    - rid: 8623673359758786560
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'In a weapon''s facts (Slice B stage 22): the chance that
          its damage on a unit is a critical hit, rolled for each unit it hits. {0}
          = percent.'
    - rid: 8623673359758786561
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A critical hit (stage 22), just before its damage line. {0}
          = source. {1} = target.
    - rid: 8623673359758786562
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Fatigue from taking a critical hit (stage 22). {0} = unit.
          {1} = amount. {2} = fatigue after.
    - rid: 8623673359758786563
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The small word over a critical hit's number (stage 22, Round
          60 mock A in the damage red).
    - rid: 8623673361877958656
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A critical hit's HP lost (stage 22), under Fx.Crit. {0} =
          HP lost.
    - rid: 8623673459348865024
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'The first tier above Common (one merge). Round 69: the tiers
          count stars, as TFT does.'
    - rid: 8623673459348865025
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The second tier above Common.
    - rid: 8623673459348865026
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The last tier of an item.
    - rid: 8623673467615838208
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'The camp''s forge (Slice B stage 23): the title of its card
          and of its step. Shown only while a recipe is ready on a board.'
    - rid: 8623673467615838209
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the forge card. {0} = the mercenary. {1} = the base item
          with its tier. {2} = the catalyst with its tier. {3} = the unique item
          made.
    - rid: 8623673467615838210
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Title of the camp window in the forge step. {0} = floor.
    - rid: 8623673467615838211
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'In the camp window in the forge step: the price.'
    - rid: 8623673467615838212
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'On the board panel in the forge step: which boards take a
          click.'
    - rid: 8623673467615838213
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Forges the chosen item and goes on.
    - rid: 8623673467615838214
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: In a unique item's facts (stage 23), first.
    - rid: 8623673467615838215
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Under a unique item''s facts (stage 23): the party holds
          one.'
    - rid: 8623673467615838216
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Under the plate of a unique item's card (stage 23). A unique
          has no tier.
    - rid: 8623673467615838217
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the card of a recipe's base or catalyst (stage 23). {0}
          = the base with its tier. {1} = the catalyst with its tier. {2} = the unique
          item.
    - rid: 8623673477085003776
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Past the last day: the only expedition left is the final
          stand against the final dungeon''s boss.'
    - rid: 8623673477085003777
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'The run was won: the final boss fell.'
    - rid: 8623673477085003778
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = the death limit.'
    - rid: 8623673477085003779
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The final stand was lost.
    - rid: 8623673477085003780
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'The run was won with this expedition: the final boss fell.'
    - rid: 8623673477085003781
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'The run was lost with this expedition: the deaths reached
          the limit.'
    - rid: 8623673477085003782
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'The run was lost with this expedition: the final stand was
          lost.'
    - rid: 8623673477476384768
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Header of the expedition screen (round 71 E2).
    - rid: 8623673477476384769
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Back to the lobby.
    - rid: 8623673477476384770
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The company's town on the map.
    - rid: 8623673477476384771
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Under a dungeon's marker. {0} = clears, {1} = days it takes.
    - rid: 8623673477476384772
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Under a locked dungeon's marker. {0} = the dungeon whose clears
          open it, {1} = how many.
    - rid: 8623673477476384773
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = map floors before the boss.'
    - rid: 8623673477476384774
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = days the dungeon takes, {1} = the day the party is
          back.'
    - rid: 8623673477476384775
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: One kind of starting potion in the details. {0} = its name,
          {1} = how many.
    - rid: 8623673477476384776
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
