    - rid: 8623673477476384777
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Under the final dungeon's details.
    - rid: 8623673477476384779
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Starts the expedition.
    - rid: 8623673477476384780
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The chosen dungeon is still locked.
    - rid: 8623673478542524416
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the final dungeon's marker. {0} = its name.
    - rid: 8623673478542524417
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Row label in the details.
    - rid: 8623673478542524418
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Row label in the details.
    - rid: 8623673478542524419
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Row label in the details.
    - rid: 8623673478542524420
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Row label in the details.
    - rid: 8623673478542524421
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Row label in the details.
    - rid: 8623673478542524422
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{0} = times the dungeon was cleared.'
    - rid: 8623673478542524423
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Under every open dungeon's details. {0} = the last day, {1}
          = the final dungeon.
    - rid: 8623673479834370048
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "The header past the last day (Docs/Design/04 \xA72): the
          day counter, then that only the final stand is left. {0} = current day,
          {1} = total days."
    - rid: 8623673479834370049
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The company's gold in the header and the windows (stage 26).
          {0} = gold.
    - rid: 8623673479834370050
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Dismisses a mercenary from the roster for good (stage 26,
          the barracks).
    - rid: 8623673479834370051
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'The strip''s button past the last day: it opens the expedition
          screen where only the final stand is left.'
    - rid: 8623673479834370052
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'The plate of the barracks (Round 71): the roster, the party
