    - rid: 8623673479834370060
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The bubble over the inn. {0} = the breakdown threshold, {1}
          = mercenaries at or over it, {2} = the treatment's price.
    - rid: 8623673479834370061
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The bubble over the stagecoach. {0} = candidates, {1} = the
          hire price.
    - rid: 8623673479834370062
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A locked dungeon in the gate's bubble. {0} = its name.
    - rid: 8623673479834370063
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Title of the barracks window.
    - rid: 8623673479834370064
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Title of the inn window.
    - rid: 8623673479834370065
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Title of the stagecoach window.
    - rid: 8623673479834370066
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: In the summaries. {0} = mercenaries in the roster, {1} = the
