    - rid: 8623673479834370067
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: In the summaries. {0} = the dead so far, {1} = the death limit.
    - rid: 8623673479834370068
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: In the barracks summary, per open dungeon. {0} = the dungeon,
          {1} = its clears.
    - rid: 8623673479834370069
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: In the barracks summary, per locked dungeon. {0} = the dungeon,
          {1} = the dungeon whose clears open it, {2} = how many.
    - rid: 8623673479834370070
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The button that hires a candidate. {0} = the price.
    - rid: 8623673479834370071
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Shown in the stagecoach window when nobody is waiting.
    - rid: 8623673479834370072
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Under the candidates.
    - rid: 8623673479834370073
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The button that treats a mercenary at the inn. {0} = the price,
          {1} = how much fatigue it takes off.
    - rid: 8623673479834370074
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Under the inn''s list: the treatment takes no day.'
    - rid: 8623673479834370075
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Row of the result window: the day the run ended.'
    - rid: 8623673479834370076
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A day as a value. {0} = the day.
    - rid: 8623673479834370077
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Row of the result window: how many expeditions.'
    - rid: 8623673479834370078
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: A count of expeditions. {0} = the count.
    - rid: 8623673479834370079
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The expeditions with their split by dungeon. {0} = the count,
