    - rid: 8623673481061990405
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: One survivor that reached a new level. {0} = the name, {1}
          = the level now.
    - rid: 8623673481662824448
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'A boss entered a phase (stage 28): its items were replaced.
          {0} = unit, {1} = the phase number counting the start as 1, {2} = the HP
          percent it starts at.'
    - rid: 8623673481662824449
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Rises over a boss that entered a phase (stage 28). {0} = the
          phase number.
    - rid: 8623673493283405824
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The sell button on an item's card while at a shop (2026-10-17,
          Round 74 B). {0} = the coins the shop pays.
    - rid: 8623673493283405825
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The sell button of an item that cannot be sold (the base weapon,
          a unique), off.
    - rid: 8623673493283405826
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: On the detail line after a sale. {0} = what was sold. {1}
          = coins before. {2} = coins after.
    - rid: 8623673493721710592
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: The gold the settlement paid when a cleared expedition's coins
          came home as gold (2026-10-17). {0} = gold earned in all, {1} = the floors
          reached, {2} = the coins converted (those left and the items' worth), {3}
          = the gold they made, {4} = the gold held now.
    - rid: 8623673495733927936
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
