        m_CommentText: Under an empty row of the popup's stage (round 76 D).
    - rid: 8623673495733927940
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Moves a party member one row to the front (trading places).
    - rid: 8623673495733927941
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Moves a party member one row to the back (trading places).
    - rid: 8623673497099698176
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
